               Output: m.a, m.b
         ->  Hash
               Output: m1.a
               ->  PX Broadcast 6:6  (slice2; segments: 6)
                     Output: m1.a
                     ->  Partial Seq Scan on orca.m1
                           Output: m1.a
                           Filter: (m1.a = 5)
